kpi Send-backs | about 1,725 | estimate from the Sent Back (%) column | neutral
kpi Rework cost | about $366,000 | 1,725 loops x $212 of staff time | bad
kpi Reopened within 90 days | 22% | of closed claims | bad

# The path of a claim

Every claim follows the main line from first notice of loss to closure. Three things branch off it: claims over $10,000 take a supervisor detour, a few claims are referred for a full fraud review, and urgent claims get a mitigation vendor in parallel with the inspection. The dashed lines into **Sent back for rework** are the claims returned to an earlier step; the three biggest sources are shown, with the share of claims entering that step that get sent back.

